ASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/profiles/manager.md:1139:validates marker v3, revalidates protected snapshot/artifact boundaries,\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/profiles/manager.md:1159:boundary. Valid marker v3 records mark referenced local skill snapshots,\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/profiles/manager.md:1160:complete external snapshot keys, receipt/artifact keys, and manager-generated\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:80:untrusted Go source bytes to the closed `go-v1` or `go-repository-v1` driver in\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:178:| 7 | first-class external build repositories and `go-repository-v1` |\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:185:and `go-repository-v1`. Their script, system, runtime-root, capability,\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:306:#### 4.2.1 Schema-7 external repositories and `go-repository-v1`\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:326:  \"driver\": \"go-repository-v1\",\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:334:descriptor target drivers MUST both equal `go-repository-v1`. An unknown or\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:341:Each `go-repository-v1` target MUST contain exactly `driver`, `build_root`, and\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:369:`go-repository-v1` reuses the exact `go-v1` trusted toolchain identity, native\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:448:recorded in marker v3; removal, path/ref change, or selected-commit movement\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:508:For `go-repository-v1`, the raw SSH repository path is further restricted to\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:566:Every `go-repository-v1` command binds a declared state and an effective state.\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:843:### 9.2 External `go-repository-v1` receipt schema 2\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:845:Each active external command MUST use build receipt schema 2. Its logical input\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:848:- schema version 2 and driver `go-repository-v1`;\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:930:The protected external snapshot key MUST contain the complete effective\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:934:deduplicated only when every component of the complete snapshot key is equal.\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:936:merely because snapshot bytes or snapshot keys are equal.\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:942:  snapshot, complete external frozen-snapshot key, receipt/artifact key, and\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:978:and marker-v2 entry semantics. An external `go-repository-v1` entry MUST record\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:979:receipt schema 2, repository identifier, declared identity and immutable lock,\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:1052:All `go-repository-v1` compilation MUST occur in operation-private staging\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:1078:`go-repository-v1` revision 1 performs no manager post-signing, timestamping,\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md:1106:`go-repository-v1`, accepting an unknown driver, or providing a generic build\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/decisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:25:External build repositories require manifest schema 7, build receipt schema 2,\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/decisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:28:`go-repository-v1`. They are a new rc.5 protocol surface.\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/decisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:34:field and `go-repository-v1`.\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/decisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:41:using `go-repository-v1` MUST select exactly one repository entry and exactly\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/decisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:152:External commands use receipt schema 2. Its canonical input MUST bind declared\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/decisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:159:Schema 7 MAY mix local `go-v1` and external `go-repository-v1` commands.\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/decisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:161:semantics. External commands MUST use receipt schema 2 and their own effective\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/decisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:192:The first `go-repository-v1` revision performs no post-build signing,\n/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-wy3dsw/curator-spec-worktree/decisions/0005-external-build-repositories.md:208:manager MUST NOT broaden `go-v1` or `go-repository-v1` or provide a generic\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
